 Bisquick Sausage Balls : Alex's style
 Recipe, Sausage Ball, thanksgiving, 🟢good
Ingredients [
	• 1 pound italian sweet
	• 8oz mozarella
	• 2 1/2 cups Bisquick baking mix
	• 1/4 cup cream, 1/4 water
	• italion seasoning, smoked paprika, cayenne, red pepper flake, garlic powder
]
Instructions [
	• Preheat oven to 350
	• Cook 25 minutes.
]